   "nSourceDomains": 4,
   "description": "SAID, partly supported: Habba told Trump and WH staff (Oval, Oct 9 2026) that in spring 2025 Grenell persuaded Mildon to fold a multimillion-dollar Kennedy Center gift (first $17M, later $5.6M) into a $17.6M lump-sum payment for a business deal with a US company, and the gift was never deposited (Axios, four senior officials; NY Post; Telegraph). DONE side: Kennedy Center books show only a $270K Mildon pledge, which he paid Oct 13 2026; staff searched for a ~$6M gift late 2025 and found none; WH Counsel Scharf asked for documents and had none. Grenell: 'Absurd.' Daily Beast: the two are friends with Venezuela interests. Register: grokbot-2026-10-14-I-axios-habba-grenell-kennedy-center.",
