   "newInVersion": false,
   "sourceTier": "primary",
   "singleSource": false,
   "nSourceDomains": 3,
   "description": "Sequence only. A: OFAC removed Dodik and 47 others (family, allies, companies) from the SDN list Oct 29 2025 (OFAC recent action; RFE/RL). B: within six months Dodik's party dropped its opposition and Bosnia's parliament passed legislation naming AAFS (Binnall / Joseph Flynn) lead developer of the Bosnia-Croatia gas pipeline (CBS, citing a House Democratic report). House Democrats allege the delisting enriched Trump allies; White House says it prevented Balkan instability (SAID). Two documented facts in time order; this edge claims no cause.",
   "citation": [
