   "description": "SAID (Axios, Oct 19 2026): an unnamed White House official says the May 29 2025 wire record shows the $17.6M sent to Texas Armament & Technology (Houston) came from Congo's 'Ministere des Finances', Kinshasa, not from Turhan Mildon's account ('We're trying to find out whose money this is'). SAID by Mildon via attorneys: he wired it at Grenell's direction, ~$5.6M meant for the Kennedy Center, which never got it. Axios reviewed a May 3 2025 text allegedly from Grenell: 'Once the money comes to the company here, I will arrange the donation to Kennedy Centre...'. Grenell SAID 'lies' and denies sending it. WH Counsel Will Scharf is reviewing (sources). Kennedy Center records show only a $270K Mildon pledge (Axios Oct 14). Graded I: the sender identity rests on one anonymous official; TX-AT, Congo and Mildon's lawyers did not confirm.",
