   "description": "DONE (SpaceX Form 10-Q for Q3 2026, SEC EDGAR, Note 8 and income statement; CNBC Kolodny Oct 22 2026): after TBC's September 2026 financing (the UAE-led round), SpaceX marked its equity-method stake in The Boring Company to fair value and booked a $561M unrealized gain in other income (labelled related party). It was more than half of Q3 other income ($1,025M); Q3 net income $4,404M; nine-month net loss $413M. The filing says SpaceX is presumed to have significant influence over TBC 'given the Company's CEO has a controlling voting interest in TBC'. No cash moved; accounting fact, no wrongdoing alleged.",
